flowchart TD
    User([User Request]) --> API[FastAPI Gateway]
    API --> JobManager[Job Queue & PostgreSQL]
    JobManager --> Orchestrator[LangGraph Orchestrator]
    Orchestrator --> Planner[Planner Agent]
    Planner --> Researcher[Research Agent]
    Researcher --> MCP[MCP Tools / Web / Docs]
    MCP --> Evidence[(Evidence Store)]
    Evidence --> Critic[Fact-Checker & Critic]
    Critic --> Writer[Report Synthesis]
    Writer --> Gate{Human Approval Required?}
    Gate -- Yes --> Human[Human Review Terminal/UI]
    Human -- Approved --> Final[Final Cited Whitepaper]
    Gate -- No --> Final
